                    "reading": "v rahs-SEE-ee PREE-nyah-tah ahs-tahv-LYAHT' OH-kah-lah DYEH-syat' prah-TSEHN-tahf chah-yeh-VYKH zah khah-ROH-sheh-yeh ahb-SLOO-zhy-vah-nyeh.",
