                    "target": "После обеда я всегда мою посуду и вытираю стол.",
                    "reading": "POHS-leh ah-BYEH-dah yah vsyehg-DAH MOH-yoo pah-SOO-doo ee vih-tee-RAH-yoo STOHL",
                    "translation": "After lunch I always wash the dishes and wipe the table."
