        "objective": "Siberian Winter Preservation & The Handcrafted Pelmeni (Сибирские пельмени: ручная лепка из тончайшего пресного теста на ледяной воде и яйцах; трёхсоставной фарш (говядина, свинина, сохатина/баранина) с рубленым луком и колотым талым льдом для сочности; естественная шоковая заморозка на сибирском морозе (-40°C) на деревянных досках; отваривание в крепком лавровом бульоне и подача с яблочным уксусом, сливочным маслом и свежемолотым чёрным перцем).",
        "presentation": {
            "explanation": "Siberian Pelmeni (Сибирские пельмени) and the winter survival gastronomy of the Taiga:\n- **The Siberian Winter Heritage**:\n  - Developed centuries ago by indigenous Finno-Ugric (Udmurt/Komi - *Pel-nyan* / \"Ear-bread\") and Russian Siberian pioneers crossing the Ural Mountains;\n  - The ultimate frozen survival ration: thousands of pelmeni hand-sculpted in late autumn by entire families, frozen instantaneously on outdoor wooden boards in sub-zero **Siberian winter frost ($-30^\\circ\\text{C}$ to $-40^\\circ\\text{C}$)**, stored in burlap sacks inside wooden snow sheds for months;\n- The Anatomy & Culinary Mechanics of True Pelmeni:\n  - **The Elastic Dough (Тонкое эластичное тесто)**:\n    - Flour, whole eggs, a pinch of salt, and **ice water (ледяная вода)**, kneaded until silky smooth, rolled paper-thin ($< 1\\text{mm}$) without tearing;\n  - **The Three-Meat Filling (Трёхсоставной фарш)**:\n    - Beef (structure), fatty pork (tenderness), and game/mutton/elk (*сохатина / баранина* - wild complexity) in a 45:35:20 ratio;\n    - Finely minced onions and **crushed melting ice (колотый лёд)** kneaded directly into the raw meat—when boiled, the ice melts inside the sealed dumpling, creating an explosion of savory broth in the mouth;\n  - **The Ear Shape (Ушко)**: Circular cutouts hand-crimped and folded around the finger into a tight crescent \"ear\";\n  - **Boiling & Serving**: Boiled in salted water with whole bay leaves and black peppercorns, served with **clarified butter, a dish of raw vinegar (уксус), and freshly cracked black pepper** (or sour cream).",
            "examples": [
                {
                    "target": "Настоящие сибирские пельмени лепят вручную с колотым льдом в трёхсоставном фарше и замораживают на трескучем морозе.",
                    "reading": "Nas-to-ya-shchee see-beer-skee-ye...",
                    "translation": "Authentic Siberian pelmeni are hand-folded with crushed ice in a three-meat filling and frozen in the biting frost."
                }
            ],
            "mnemonics": [
                "Сибирские пельмени (Udmurt Pel-nyan = Ear Bread)! Elastic ice-water dough! 3-meat filling (Beef, pork, game) with crushed ice for burst of broth! Siberian frost shock-freezing at -40°C! Served with butter, vinegar & black pepper!"
            ],
            "culturalNotes": [
                "In Russian family tradition, the last pelmen folded is stuffed with a surprise filling (*счастливый пельмень*): a coin (wealth), black pepper (passion), or extra dough (happiness)."
            ]
        },
